<https://id.i2idl.org/concepts/meta-adaptation> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Adaptation across multiple learning systems or resources, where one system can use shared data to recommend or coordinate interventions beyond its own immediate instructional environment." <https://id.i2idl.org/graphs/concepts/meta-adaptation/versions/1> .
